# centralize_events_alliance_2client_udp — client 2 (slot 1).
# Joins after a short delay so client 1 lands in slot 0
# deterministically. With -nolobby on the DS the game is RUNNING
# from tick 0. Client 1 is connected by the time this client
# starts, so it asks client 1 for an alliance; client 1 accepts.
# Exit is set well past c1's leave/exit so the accept round-trip
# has room to land before c2's loop terminates.
{"tick": 30, "op": "alliance_request", "from": 1, "to": 0}
{"tick": 250, "op": "exit"}
